<title>USA: TABLE - Bridgeport Machines Q1 shr down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bridgeport Machines Q1 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 28, 1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			  1,501		    2,725</p>
<p> Revs			54,546		   62,214</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,683		    5,747</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total assets on June 28 were $129 million compared with $132 million for the quarter ended March 29, 1997.</p>
<p>Results for the first quarter reflect a decline in sales in Europe resulting from continued soft market conditions and higher selling prices of the company's products due to the strength of the British poumd versus other Eurpean currencies.</p>
</text>
